<p>You consume the fear of enemies in radius 10, healing for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">5, 11, 16, 21, 25</acronym> life and gaining <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">4.0%, 5.0%, 5.8%, 6.4%, 7.0%</acronym> of a turn for each stack up to a max of 4.0 turns.</p>